{
  "$comment": "Cities Without Number SRD 3.1.3 (armor mods), 3.4.5 (weapon mods), 3.5.x (cyberware mods, not yet listed), 3.7.3 (vehicle mods), 3.8.2 (drone mods), 3.9.1 (cyberdeck mods) and 2.8 (crafting and modifying gear). The CWN SRD is CC0; every number is the SRD's and every descriptive string here is an original NooPunk summary. src/rules/cwn_gear_mods.py holds the arithmetic; data/rules/cwn_vehicles.json holds vehicle mods. Do not restate the +3 mod cap or the maintenance formula anywhere else.",
